sequenceDiagram
    participant Issuer as Credential Issuer<br/>(ABMS)
    participant Notary as Notary Service
    participant Holder as Credential Holder<br/>(Hospital)

    Note over Issuer: ISSUE FLOW
    Issuer->>Issuer: Build CredentialState<br/>(practitionerId, qualification, validUntil)
    Issuer->>Issuer: Create TransactionBuilder<br/>addOutputState(credentialState)
    Issuer->>Issuer: Contract.verify() runs locally<br/>- No inputs consumed<br/>- Status == ACTIVE<br/>- validUntil > now()
    Issuer->>Issuer: Sign initial transaction
    Issuer->>Holder: CollectSignaturesFlow
    Holder->>Holder: Verify + co-sign
    Holder-->>Issuer: Return signed tx
    Issuer->>Notary: FinalityFlow → notarize
    Notary->>Notary: Check uniqueness<br/>(no double-spend)
    Notary-->>Issuer: Notarized tx
    Issuer->>Holder: Distribute finalized tx

    Note over Holder: VERIFY FLOW
    Holder->>Holder: Query vault for<br/>CredentialState by linearId
    Holder->>Holder: Contract.verify()<br/>- Status == ACTIVE<br/>- Not expired
    Holder-->>Holder: Credential VALID ✓
